---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog — SEO & AEO insights
description: Stefan Tasevski’s take on SEO, AEO and organic growth — what works in Google and AI search for eCommerce, B2B and agency brands.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="sec" style="padding-top:40px">
  <div class="sec-head rv">
    <div class="wmk">Insights</div>
    <h1 class="sec-title">/Blog</h1>
    <p class="sec-sub">My take on SEO, AEO and organic growth — what actually moves rankings, AI citations and revenue.</p>
  </div>
  {% if collections.posts.length %}
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="post-row has-cover rv" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="post-thumb">{{ post | postCover | safe }}</div>
      <div>
        <span class="mono post-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        <div class="chips" style="margin:12px 0 0">{% for t in post.data.tags %}{% if t != "posts" %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
      </div>
      <span class="go-ic"><svg width="14" height="14"><use href="#arr"/></svg></span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="note rv" style="text-align:center">First posts are on the way. Follow on <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" style="text-decoration:underline">LinkedIn</a> or subscribe via <a href="/feed.xml" style="text-decoration:underline">RSS</a>.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
